<section class="section shell article-content"><h2>Current website architecture</h2><p class="content-copy">The website is built as a static Astro site. The repository currently does not define user accounts, comments, a first-party application backend or a telemetry service. Hosting providers, CDN logs and third-party services may process technical request data according to their own policies.</p><h2>External links</h2><p class="content-copy">Links to GitHub and other external services leave the Aurora Website origin. Their data handling is governed by the respective provider.</p><h2>Before production launch</h2><p class="content-copy">The selected hosting provider, analytics decision, cookie behavior, retention and contact route must be reviewed and this page updated before making a comprehensive legal compliance claim.</p></section>
